  "description": "The new Troy ST is the black belt in the Troy family. Insanely agile, the 130mm travel Split Pivot frame has updated geometry with size-specific chainstays that will have you riding stuff you thought you wouldn’t, fast. Its integrated downtube storage and go get ‘em attitude will lure you into all day rides on “once a year” trails, weekly. Full 29 in M-XL sizes and full 27.5 in XS-S, the ST isn’t trying to be anything it’s not. It’s made in Canada, guaranteed for life and ready to rumble. This bike is proof that with travel, sometimes less is more.",
